DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The _c_h_a_t program defines a conversational exchange between the computer
       and  the modem.  Its primary purpose is to establish the connection be‐
       tween the Point‐to‐Point Protocol Daemon (_p_p_p_d) and the  remote’s  _p_p_p_d
       process.

